{"articleNo":"803","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=803&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009-1학기 대학원 학사 및 휴복학 안내▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.01.09","hit":"25347","attachments":[{"name":"교과이수요건.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=803&attachNo=69396"},{"name":"2009-1주요학사안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=803&attachNo=69398"},{"name":"2009대학원 학사력(최종).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=803&attachNo=69400"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n</p><table style=\"WIDTH: 429px; HEIGHT: 36px\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\" width=\"429\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#999999\" border=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"427\" bgcolor=\"#feffcc\" height=\"34\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2009-1학기 대학원(산업 및 교육) 학사 및 휴복학 안내</strong></span></font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 2009학년도 1학기 개강일 : </span></font><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 3. 2(월)</span></font></u></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 수강신청</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.&nbsp;재학생·복학생 : </span></font><strong><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#1e90ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 2. 17(화) ~ 2. 20(금) [4일간]</span></font></u></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 2009학년도 전기 신입생 : </span></font><strong><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 2. 23(월) ~ 2. 26(목) [4일간]</span></font></u></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수강신청 확인 및 변경기간 : </span></font><strong><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 3. 4(수) ~ 3. 6(금) [3일간]</span></font></u></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 폐강과목 수강정정기간 : </span></font><strong><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 3. 12(목) ~ 3. 16(월) [3일간]</span></font></u></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 신청방법 : 본교 홈페이지(www.kumoh.ac.kr) 수강신청 배너 접속</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 등록금 납부</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 등록금고지서 발급 : 본교 홈페이지에서 출력하여 납부하여야 함</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (우편송부 하지 않음)</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 재학생 및 복학예정자 : 본교 홈페이지(www.kumoh.ac.kr)에 접속 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#1e90ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">→ 원스톱서비스 클릭 → 로그인 → 등록 → 등록금고지서 조회/출력</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) 홈페이지에서 등록금고지서가 발급되지 않는 자</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ </span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">분할납부자, 역학기복학자</span></font></strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 학사서비스센터에서(☎478-7115) 신청 및 발급</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ </span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">학기초과자(등록학기가 대학원 석·박사 4학기, 산업 및 교육 5학기를 초과 </span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 한 학생)는&nbsp;</span></font></strong><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">수강신청 후</span></font></strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 학사서비스센터에서</span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(☎478-7115)</span></font></strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 신청 및 발급 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 학기초과자는 수강신청한 학점에 따라 등록금액이 책정됨</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 1-3학점까지 : 당해 학기 등록금의 1/2해당 금액</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 4학점이상 : 당해 학기 등록금 전액</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;<strong>나. 등록금 납부기간 :<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 2. 17(화) ~ 2. 20(금) [4일간]</font></u></span></strong></span></font><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><u> </u></strong></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 다. 납부장소</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 재학생 및 복학예정자 : </span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">농협[단위농협 포함],&nbsp;대구은행, 우체국,</span></font></strong><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 신한은행</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전국 각 지점</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) 등록금 분할납부자, 역학기 복학자, 학기초과등록자 :<font color=\"#1e90ff\"> </font></span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#1e90ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">본교 내 농협(글로벌관 </span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#1e90ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1층 128호) </span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ 등록금 고지서가 수작업으로 발급되므로 지정은행만 납부 가능함</span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 라. 등록금 분할납부 신청 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 신청기간 : </span></font><strong><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 2. 17(화) ~ 2. 20(금) [4일간]</span></span></font></u></strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → </span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림 분할납부</span></font></strong><font color=\" #1e90ff\"=\"\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 신청 가능</span></font></strong><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></font></strong></p><strong>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2) 1차 납부 : 2009. 2. 17(화) ~ &nbsp;2. 20(금)[4일간] </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; → </span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">등록금액의 1/3 또는 1/2 이 </span></font></strong><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">상 납부 </span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 2차 납부 : 2009. 3. 18(수) ~ 3. 20(금)[3일간] </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2009. 4. 15(수) ~ 4. 17(금)[3일간]</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 중 택일하여 납부</span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> → 등록금액에서 1차 납부한 나머지 금액 전액 납부 </span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(4) 제출서류 : 등록금분할신청서<font color=\"#8b008b\">(</font> </span></font><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#8b008b\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">본인 및 보호자 도장 반드시 지참</span></font><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#8b008b\">)</font> </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 등록금을 납부하지 않는 학생은 학칙 등 관련규정에 의거 조치됨. &nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 휴 &nbsp;학(인터넷 접수) </span></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : &nbsp;</span></font><strong><u><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2009. 2. 17(화) ~ 2. 20(금) [4일간]</span></font></u></strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수절차 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 우리대학 홈페이지 원스톱서비스 로그인 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 학적 → 휴학신청접수 → 군입대 및 질병휴학자 관련서류제출(24시간이내)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력하여야 함》 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 휴학 확정 여부 확인 : 접수 및 구비서류 제출 후 다음날 오후 1시 이후(휴일제외)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적 → 학적 및 각종자료조회 → 학적변동》</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림??은 수업일수 </span></font><strong><font color=\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1/4선(3월27일)까지만 허용됨</span></font><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"justify\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 인터넷으로 휴학 신청시 제출서류&nbsp; </span></font></strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font>\n</p><table cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\" width=\"500\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#999999\" border=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"42\" bgcolor=\"#feffcc\" height=\"30\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">구 분</span></font></strong></p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"59\" bgcolor=\"#feffcc\" height=\"30\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">일반휴학</span></font></strong></p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"176\" bgcolor=\"#feffcc\" height=\"30\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">군입대휴학</span></font></strong></p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"194\" bgcolor=\"#feffcc\" height=\"30\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">질병휴학</span></font></strong></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td width=\"42\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"56\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">제출해야 할구비 서류</span></font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"59\" bgcolor=\"#ffccfe\" height=\"56\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">제출서류 없음</span></font></strong></p>\n            </td>\n            <td width=\"176\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"56\">\n            <p align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입영통지서 또는 군복무</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#494949\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 확인서 사본 1부</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font face=\"굴림\" co